son:**  \nPair of Tens with Ace on board is decent; opponent’s passivity suggests they could be weak and fold to aggression, or call with worse. Betting 100 (small relative to pot, no pot size given but assuming blinds 50/100 or similar) is a standard continuation bet / value bet.  \n\n---\n\n**Answer:** 100'}
